# Generated type artifacts — regenerate locally with:
#   cd beam-web && bun run codegen:openapi:full
#
# `openapi.json` is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the contract between the
# server and every client, and while it was ignored a breaking API change was
# invisible in review. It is committed, and `mise run codegen:openapi:check`
# fails when the regenerated spec differs, so drift shows up as a diff.
src/api.gen.ts
